+Fix duplicate transactions and payees, and wrong opening balances, when two devices link or import the same bank account before syncing with each other, stop deleted pending bank transactions coming back once they are booked, warn instead of guessing when a transfer gets different amounts on each side from two devices, keep split lines in the same month and account as their split, and fix tag and "matches" rules, "is not" rules, schedule detection, 6 and 12 month budget averages, template goals, bank opening balance dates and some OFX and CAMT imports
